WEBVTT

NOTE English captions for the video "MEHI's voice agent" (narration in English).

1
00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:03.350
It's three in the morning.

2
00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:06.338
Someone needs to know how
to complete a government procedure...

3
00:00:06.357 --> 00:00:09.162
and on the other end, someone answers.

4
00:00:10.416 --> 00:00:12.509
This is MEHI's voice agent.

5
00:00:12.529 --> 00:00:18.621
A superintelligence that answers real calls,
in Spanish, as naturally as a person.

6
00:00:18.641 --> 00:00:21.471
Twenty-four hours a day,
seven days a week.

7
00:00:21.491 --> 00:00:22.746
No lines.

8
00:00:22.766 --> 00:00:24.096
No waiting.

9
00:00:25.248 --> 00:00:29.803
When someone calls, the agent listens,
understands what they need,

10
00:00:29.823 --> 00:00:33.515
and answers with official,
verified information.

11
00:00:33.535 --> 00:00:36.541
It logs the request,
resolves the inquiry...

12
00:00:36.561 --> 00:00:38.515
and if they need to talk to someone,

13
00:00:38.535 --> 00:00:42.891
it hands them off to a human operator,
with no need to call back.

14
00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.295
How is it built?

15
00:00:45.315 --> 00:00:47.720
With three layers that work together.

16
00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:51.983
A state-of-the-art voice engine that
understands and speaks in real time.

17
00:00:52.003 --> 00:00:56.708
A conversation flow designed procedure
by procedure, with clear rules.

18
00:00:56.728 --> 00:00:58.182
No improvising.

19
00:00:58.203 --> 00:01:00.807
And a knowledge base curated by people:

20
00:01:00.828 --> 00:01:04.095
every answer comes from
an approved official record.

21
00:01:04.115 --> 00:01:06.095
Never from something made up.

22
00:01:07.248 --> 00:01:11.716
And behind every call is MEHI,
the platform that oversees it all.

23
00:01:11.736 --> 00:01:13.191
Real-time metrics.

24
00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:16.365
Automatic analysis of every conversation.

25
00:01:16.385 --> 00:01:17.828
Quality alerts.

26
00:01:17.848 --> 00:01:21.591
And a team that reviews
and improves the agent every day.

27
00:01:22.628 --> 00:01:24.846
Hundreds of simultaneous calls,

28
00:01:24.866 --> 00:01:28.933
with enterprise-grade security
and personal data protection.

29
00:01:28.953 --> 00:01:31.671
Because on the other end,
there are people.

30
00:01:33.004 --> 00:01:33.822
MEHI.

31
00:01:33.841 --> 00:01:36.197
Superintelligence that answers.
